You are free to share and adapt this data for any purpose, including commercially, as long as you give
appropriate credit (for example: "Weather Station Archive, github.com/adsitb/weather-station-archive").

Third-party data in this archive:

- Forecast data (forecasts/): Weather data by Open-Meteo.com (https://open-meteo.com/), licensed under
  CC BY 4.0. Reuse must credit Open-Meteo.com.
- Observations and official daily climate values (observations/, daily_climate/): from NOAA, the National
  Weather Service, the NOAA Aviation Weather Center and NOAA MADIS. US government works, public domain in the
  United States. Daily climate values were read through the Iowa Environmental Mesonet's archive of the NWS
  climate reports.

The data is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. It is not an official record; for official
values consult the National Weather Service.
